From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ad5xrecon <ad5xrecon@localhost>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 13:00:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] i18n: wizard texts, Back/Cancel and refill dropdowns
 translated; Russian fixes (issue #23)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- The AD5X wizard's step descriptions, summary labels and restart
  messages (20 strings in tables, so the extractor never found them)
  are in en.yml and ru.yml.
- The wizard's Back/Cancel label goes through lv_tr() (upstream set it
  untranslated in every language).
- The auto-refill dropdowns carry options_tag, so their Russian shows.
- Russian: two titles/buttons shortened to fit ("Настройка принтера:
  лоток", "Сохранить"); no → or № (the screen font has neither); one
  Pressure Advance capitalised. Kiln's own "Slot {} · {} → {}" uses an
  em dash, so English no longer shows a box either.
---
 src/ui/ui_settings_ad5x_refill.cpp       |  2 +-
 src/ui/ui_wizard.cpp                     |  2 +-
 tests/unit/test_settings_ad5x_refill.cpp |  6 ++--
 translations/en.yml                      | 22 ++++++++++++++-
 translations/ru.yml                      | 36 ++++++++++++++++++------
 ui_xml/settings_ad5x_refill_overlay.xml  |  2 ++
 6 files changed, 56 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/ui/ui_settings_ad5x_refill.cpp b/src/ui/ui_settings_ad5x_refill.cpp
index 99329c86cc..0a1cb294dd 100644
--- a/src/ui/ui_settings_ad5x_refill.cpp
+++ b/src/ui/ui_settings_ad5x_refill.cpp
@@ -211,7 +211,7 @@ std::string backup_line(const SlotBackup& slot) {
         }
         target = fmt::format(fmt::runtime(lv_tr("Slots {}")), list);
     }
-    return fmt::format(fmt::runtime(lv_tr("Slot {} · {} → {}")), slot.slot, what, target);
+    return fmt::format(fmt::runtime(lv_tr("Slot {} · {} — {}")), slot.slot, what, target);
 }
 
 bool any_backup(const std::vector<SlotBackup>& slots) {
diff --git a/src/ui/ui_wizard.cpp b/src/ui/ui_wizard.cpp
index 9fa1f2e5cc..57cb2bec03 100644
